        dat("THE WRITE vow_delay_barred — a BLOCK on israel_people at the chapters' own day (DK2); THE PARAMETER the_delays_clock (three feasts from Nisan — Rosh Hashanah 1:1, vows' two dues); bears_sin the reference at its second seat; the exam's person who lets three feasts pass with his vow unpaid — the delay's prohibition transgressed")
